posts.text:
We need to fire the people who are letting museums weaponize against us. Following an executive order calling for a full audit of the National Museum of American History, the Trump administration released a sweeping report outlining thousands of shortcomings in how American history is presented.

Read the full story here: heritage.org/press/heritage-…

@Gundisalvus is the Angeles T. Arredondo E Pluribus Unum Senior Fellow at The Heritage Foundation.

Several states, mainly led by Democratic governors, have chosen not to send official representatives to the Great American State Fair to showcase their state.

Cara C. Pavalock-D'Amato, member of the Connecticut House of Representatives from the 77th district, responds.

@cthousegop

